<h1>About this question tracker</h1>

<p>
    This question tracker helps JEE/NEET aspirants to solve more questions and
    get their doubts clarified. Here are some of the features: 

    <ul>
        <li>It contains a planner which helps the students to plan and solve the questions.
        <li>It contains a section where they can identify and solve their weak areas.
        <li>It also contains a section for motivational quotes to keep the students back on track when something bad haapens.
        <li>Finally, it contains an AI assistant which helps get doubts clarified and provides support to the student.
    </ul>


<b>Features not in the prototype</b>

<ul>
    <li>Timer for each task in study planner
    <li>Flow state manager
    <li>Not detailed section for weak areas
    <li>Statistics in question tracker
    <li>Easy-medium-hard classification of questions
    <li>Adding other action besides questions in tracker
    <li>Summary manager
    <li>JEE mode/NEET mode in AI assistant
    <li>PYQ recommendation
</ul>

</p>